# Phase 6: URL Parameter Sanitizer Patch
# Target: X/UEU.smali LIZLLL method
# Location: smali_classes15/X/UEU.smali starting at line 3864
# Date: 2025-10-20

## Changes Summary
- Strips all query parameters (everything after '?') from canonical URLs
- Removes tracking: utm_*, share_*, _d, _r, etc.
- Returns clean URLs: https://www.tiktok.com/@user/video/ID

## Register Allocation
- v0: int (indexOf result)
- v1: String (URL - modified in-place)
- v2: String (const-string literals)
- v3: String (log messages)

## Method Signature
.method public static final LIZLLL(ILjava/lang/String;Ljava/lang/String;Ljava/lang/String;)LX/Wu4;
    .registers 8  # Changed from 6 to 8 for additional local registers

## Patch Code (Production - Insert after line 3864)

**PRODUCTION VERSION** (No Debug Logs):
```smali
    # After: invoke-static {p2, p1, p3}, LX/UEa;->LIZ(...)  [line 3859]
    move-result-object v1

    # PHASE 6: URL Parameter Sanitizer - Strip all tracking parameters
    # Null check - skip if shortener returned null
    if-eqz v1, :keep_shortened_c

    # Find '?' character (use v0 for int result)
    const-string v2, "?"
    invoke-virtual {v1, v2}, Ljava/lang/String;->indexOf(Ljava/lang/String;)I
    move-result v0

    # Skip cleaning if no '?' or '?' at position 0 (v0 <= 0)
    if-lez v0, :check_shortened

    # Substring from 0 to '?' position - removes entire tracking blob
    const/4 v2, 0x0
    invoke-virtual {v1, v2, v0}, Ljava/lang/String;->substring(II)Ljava/lang/String;
    move-result-object v1

    :check_shortened
    :keep_shortened_c

    # Continue to TextUtils.isEmpty check and rest of method
```

**DEVELOPMENT VERSION** (With Debug Logs - For Reference Only):
See "Debug Logging Strategy" section below for the validation logs that were removed.

## Integration Notes

1. **Prerequisites**:
   - Method must have `.registers 8` (minimum) - original has 6, needs 2 additional locals
   - Patch location: After `move-result-object v1` from UEa.LIZ() call (line 3864)

2. **Control Flow** (Production):
   - Line 3859: `invoke-static {p2, p1, p3}, LX/UEa;->LIZ(...)`
   - Line 3864: `move-result-object v1` (URL from UEa.LIZ)
   - **→ PHASE 6 PATCH STARTS HERE (lines 3866-3884)**
   - Line 3866: Null check `if-eqz v1, :keep_shortened_c`
   - Line 3876: Sanitization guard `if-lez v0, :check_shortened`
   - Line 3883-3884: Labels `:check_shortened` and `:keep_shortened_c` (fall through)
   - Line 3887: `invoke-static {v1}, Landroid/text/TextUtils;->isEmpty(...)`
   - **→ PATCH ENDS, original method continues**

3. **Label Usage** (Production):
   - `:keep_shortened_c` - Jump target for null check, also used by existing code downstream
   - `:check_shortened` - Fall-through label, joins with `:keep_shortened_c`
   - **Removed labels**: `:url_already_clean` (obsolete from Phase 6a validation), `:swap_canonical_c` (Phase 5)

4. **Type Safety**:
   - v0: exclusively int (indexOf result)
   - v1: exclusively String (URL throughout - modified in-place)
   - v2: exclusively String (const-string literals, safely reused)
   - v3: String (reserved, unused in production)
   - p0-p3: method parameters (untouched)

