**Edge Cases Handled**:
- ✅ URL without `?` → indexOf returns -1 → if-lez jumps → no substring → URL unchanged
- ✅ URL with `?` at position 0 → indexOf returns 0 → if-lez jumps → URL unchanged
- ✅ URL with `?` at position > 0 → substring(0, index) → tracking removed
- ✅ Null URL → handled by if-eqz guard → jumps to :keep_shortened_c

